{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nListening TCP/UDP ports and their owning process.\n\n## Spec\n- Source: `lsof -nP -iTCP -sTCP:LISTEN -iUDP` on macOS, `ss -tulnp` on Linux, parsed in the background; entries the current user cannot see are shown as `(no access)` rather than hidden silently\n- Columns: proto, address:port, PID, process name\n- `Enter` jumps to the owning process in the processes pane; `/` search over port / name\n\nPart of #93.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:29Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":96,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Procs: ports pane"}
